<div class="alert alert-warning">
  <strong>The AI&rsquo;s answer could not be used.</strong>
  <p class="mb-1"><%= check.failure_reason %>.</p>
  <p class="mb-2 small">
    The answer did not match the expected shape or broke one of this check&rsquo;s rules: it may only cite sources
    from your list, may only name people who are in your notes or sources, and never writes prose. Check again, or
    edit the template in the admin panel to tighten the instructions.
  </p>
  <%= render "story_drafts/check_button", story_draft: story_draft, label: "Retry",
             button_class: "btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm" %>
</div>
